   "source": [
    "## Step 4: BOM Explosion \u2014 FG Demand to RM Requirements\n",
    "\n",
    "The Bill of Materials connects finished goods to their raw material components. BOM explosion translates FG demand forecasts into RM gross requirements, propagating uncertainty through the quantile forecasts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 4.1 BOM Explosion (yield-adjusted)\n",
    "print(f'BOM entries: {len(bom)}')\n",
    "print(f'FG codes in BOM: {bom[\"fg_code\"].nunique()}')\n",
    "\n",
