    "## Step 6.4: MILP Slotting Alternative (Production Pattern)\n",
    "\n",
    "Small mixed-integer programme assigns **A-class** SKUs to the best locations deterministically. This is the enterprise alternative to stochastic GA for constrained slotting subproblems.\n"
   ]
